From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:33:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/45] Send selection details in the Specula feed

New record kinds 11 to 15, skipped by an encoder that does not know them,
carry what the selection panels and status bars show: template details
(selection overlay, footprint, status bars, names, icon, classes and
components), per-entity details (hitpoints, capture points, resources,
gatherers, experience, production queue, garrison, foundation and repair
progress, UnitAI state, trainable and researchable lists, pack and
upgrade progress, holder, trader gain), string lists, renames and the
players' economy. Values are read as GuiInterface.GetEntityState reads
them.
